---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import StaticPage from "../../components/StaticPage.astro";
---

<Base locale="en" title="Privacy policy — Allergoscreen">
  <StaticPage
    locale="en"
    title="Privacy policy"
    intro="How we process patients' personal data on the website and in the chat widget."
    inProgress
  >
    <p>
      Allergoscreen LLP processes personal data in accordance with the Law of the Republic of
      Kazakhstan No. 94-V of 21 May 2013 “On Personal Data and Their Protection”.
    </p>
    <h2 class="!text-[24px] !mt-8 !mb-3">What data we collect</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5">
      <li>Contact details left via the feedback form (name, phone, email).</li>
      <li>Messages sent in the website chat widget.</li>
      <li>Technical browser data (User-Agent, IP) — for spam protection and analytics.</li>
      <li>Cookies — only for the chat to work and for basic traffic analytics.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="!text-[24px] !mt-8 !mb-3">How we use the data</h2>
    <p>
      To contact you at your request (call, WhatsApp / Telegram message), answer a question about a
      test, and pass your request to a lab operator. Data is not shared with third parties for
      marketing purposes; sharing is limited to engaged processing partners (for example, the
      chat-assistant service — see the section below) and to cases expressly provided for by the
      legislation of the Republic of Kazakhstan.
    </p>
    <h2 class="!text-[24px] !mt-8 !mb-3">Medical results</h2>
    <p>
      Test results are delivered EXCLUSIVELY via the secure portal
      <a class="text-brand-700 hover:underline" href="https://allergoscreen.bregis.kz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">allergoscreen.bregis.kz</a>
      using patient identification (IIN + patient code). We never send results through open channels
      (WhatsApp / Telegram / email).
    </p>
    <h2 class="!text-[24px] !mt-8 !mb-3">Engaged partners, cross-border transfer and automated (AI) / cloud processing</h2>
    <p>
      To run the website chat assistant and to handle enquiries we engage processing partners that
      use automated (including AI-based) and cloud services. This may involve cross-border transfer
      of personal data. Processing is carried out on behalf of Allergoscreen LLP and only to the
      extent needed to answer your request.
    </p>
    <p>
      The messages you type into the website chat are processed by an AI assistant and the cloud
      service of an engaged partner (SIPmind, <a class="text-brand-700 hover:underline" href="https://sipmind.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sipmind.net</a>).
      Do not enter sensitive data in the chat; test results are never sent to the chat — only the
      secure personal account is used for them.
    </p>
    <h2 class="!text-[24px] !mt-8 !mb-3">Withdrawing consent</h2>
    <p>
      Consent to the processing of personal data — including its cross-border transfer and processing
      using automated (AI) and cloud services of engaged partners — may be withdrawn at any time by
      calling <a class="text-brand-700 hover:underline" href="tel:+77024786568">+7 702 478 65 68</a>.
      Withdrawal does not affect processing carried out before the withdrawal was received or
      processing carried out on other lawful grounds.
    </p>
    <h2 class="!text-[24px] !mt-8 !mb-3">Contacts</h2>
    <p>
      For personal-data processing matters: <a class="text-brand-700 hover:underline" href="tel:+77024786568">+7 702 478 65 68</a>.
      The full version of this document will be published in this section after review by our legal team.
    </p>
  </StaticPage>
</Base>
